    battery  value=battery_level max=100 unit=%  color=(>20 ? #22d3ee : #ef4444)
    range    value=round(convertDistanceFromSI(rated_range)) max=(km 644 / mi 400) color=#4ade80
    inside   value=round(convertTempFromSI(inside_temp)) max=(°C 50 / °F 122) color=#f59e0b
    outside  value=round(convertTempFromSI(outside_temp)) max=tempMax color=#a78bfa
  Stat grid (web StatCard, default-2 / md-4 cols), exact source order:
    Inside Temp, Outside Temp, Odometer(fmtInt grouped), Range, Status(Locked/Unlocked),
    Sentry(On/Off), Firmware(software_version), Power(fmtNumber + "kW").
  Identity: display_name title + StatusBadge(toStatus(vehicleState?.state ?? vehicle.state)) + mono VIN +
    model Badge. Photo: optional photoUrl → AsyncImage, alt = "{{name}} photo" interpolated with display_name.
  Actions: Details → /vehicles/:id · Commands → /…/commands · Live Map → /…/map (host-injected onNavigate).
  Status dots (web FSM badgeDot, types/fsm/vehicle.ts + theme.ts): online green-400, driving blue-500,
    charging yellow-400, parked cyan-500, updating indigo-500, asleep purple-500, offline red-400.
  Converters 1:1 with web unitConversion.ts; Math.round half-toward-+∞ for gauge/stat ints; fmtInt/fmtNumber
    grouped half-up NaN/±∞→0 (numberFormat.ts). Verified values (XCTest): 480000 m → "480" km / "298" mi;
    160934400 m → "100,000" mi / "160,934" km; 22.5 °C → 23 °C / "73" °F; power 0 → "0.00 kW", -11 → "-11.00".
  States (every one renders, never a blank box): loading skeleton · empty (no vehicle) · error+retry ·
    content (gauges+stats OR no-live-data fallback when vehicleState==null) · stale chip+banner (auto-refresh
    once) · offline chip+banner (cached values stay visible). Bound only via P1/S8 model.
  Telemetry: model.start() emits P1/S11 `view.opened` with surface slug "VehicleHeroCard" (idempotent — XCTest).
